  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'otyamanga ku kiiwulo okulya n'omuntu ow'ekitiibwa, weegenderezanga bye bataire mu maiso go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'oba ng'oli muntu alya einho, weepimiranga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otavuvuuganiranga birungo bye by'agabula, kuba asobola okuba ng'ali kukuleba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteekanulanga olw'okwenda okufuna obukombe, banga mugezi ng'obalirira obulamu bwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba obukombe osobola okububona oti, aye bwavaagho mangu bwaba ng'oti bumeze maghagha, bwagulukagho ng'oti n'enkookooma bw'egulukira ghaigulu n'ebulagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otaganhanga kuja kulya mere ya mukodo era otavuvuuganiranga birungo bye by'agabula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba, nga bw'alowooza munda, ni ku ngulu bw'ali. Akukoba ati: “Lya era onhwe,” aye ng'omwoyo gwe gukuziraku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olisesema by'oliire byonabyona, ni by'oyogeire ebirungi bya kufa bityo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otayogeranga na musiru, kuba amagezi g'omugha aja kuganhooma bunhoome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otakyusanga mbibi ey'eira, oba okutoola eitaka lya bamulekwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba Musengwa Katonda Omununuzi waibwe w'amaani, era alibawolezagho omusango gwaibwe n'iwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oisanga omwoyo ku bye bakugalagira, era waawulirisanga eby'amagezi bye bakwegeresa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otalobanga kukangaivula mwana okumukuba omwigo ti kumwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu butuufu okumukuba, kuwonia obulamu bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wange, bw'oba omugezi zeena nsangaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndisagamba bwe ndikuwulira ng'oyogera ebituufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteegombanga boonooni naire, aye sigalanga ng'otya Musengwa Katonda ekiseera kyonakyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo obulamu bwo obw'omu maiso bubenga bukalamu, n'ebyo by'osuubira birobenga kukufa busa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wange, wulirisanga bukalamu obe mugezi, era ofengayo inho okutereeza obulamu bwo mu ngira entuufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weesambenga abantu abanhwa einho omwenge, n'abo abeesokera emere embitirivu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba abatamiivu n'abaluvu baavughala, era ole bw'aba ng'akola gwa kulya na gwa kutenduka, talwa kuvaala nkanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulirisanga lata wo, kuba n'eyakuzaala era otanhoomereranga inhoko, waire ng'akairiighe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oghangayo empiiya waagula amazima, n'amagezi, n'okugalagirwa, n'okutegeera, aye otabitundanga naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu omutuufu, aleetera ise okusagamba einho, era ole ali n'amagezi, aleetera eyamuzaala okusangaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka lata wo n'inhoko basangaale leka omukazi eyakuzaala asagambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
